```
:::
:::


Exact and right-censored values give a right-censored response:

::: {#f4584bf7 .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
gw.as_surv(gw.event_time(time=[7, 5], status=["e", "r"]))
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=2}
```
Surv(type=right, n=2, events=1)
```
:::
:::
